{"candidateAnswer":"A few times","evidence":"[D11:7 | 9:48 am on 8 July, 2023] Andrew: Yeah definitely ! I'm down for a hike with you and your furry friends. Let's do it next month when the weather is more pleasant. Here's the trail that I think it'd be great for the dogs.\n[D24:13 | 6:12 pm on 19 October, 2023] Audrey: I can't wait for our hike with the furry friends next month - it's gonna be awesome!\n[D26:20 | 2:36 pm on 28 October, 2023] Andrew: Yay! Does Saturday sound good? We can grab some snacks and have a blast exploring. Because on Sunday I am going on a picnic date with my girlfriend.","itemId":"urn:uuid:c5f92f93-f2fc-5146-b337-a8791e47444a","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:26147c8d48d793632d7ee24b1667d20ac8bbd21edaf9487d9cbbcc2f6e50e794","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"How many times did Audrey and Andew plan to hike together?","referenceAnswer":"three times","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"26147c8d48d793632d7ee24b1667d20ac8bbd21edaf9487d9cbbcc2f6e50e794"}}]}